# Desolation of Smaug's "Dragon" is a word of its text (CR 612.2): Bot1 casts Artificial Evolution on its own Desolation
# of Smaug on the stack, Dragon to Elf. It now deals 3 damage to each non-Elf creature - Bot1's Phyrexian Dragon Engine
# dies, Bot2's Llanowar Elves lives - and its mana is "only to cast Elf spells" (CR 106.6). With {R}{R}{G}{G} of it in the
# pool Magmatic Hellkite, a Dragon its colors could pay for, can't be cast; Bot1's own Llanowar Elves is cast with one {G}.

